  <div class="khas-about-container">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="khas-about-hero">
      <div class="khas-about-crown">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 35" width="100" height="35" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M 40,30 L 60,30 L 62,24 L 56,26 L 50,15 L 44,26 L 38,24 Z" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="50" cy="13" r="1.5" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="38" cy="22" r="1" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="62" cy="22" r="1" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <path d="M 42,28 Q 50,29 58,28" stroke="#fabd2f" stroke-width="1" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1 class="khas-about-title">About Us</h1>
      <p class="khas-about-subtitle">Our Story, Our Passion</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <div class="khas-about-content">
      <div class="khas-about-text-block">
        <p class="khas-about-text">
          At KHAS Foods, we believe great cooking begins with exceptional ingredients. For years, we have been dedicated to sourcing, processing, and delivering premium-quality spices that bring authentic flavor, aroma, and richness to every meal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="khas-about-text-block">
        <p class="khas-about-text">
          Our commitment to quality starts with carefully selected raw ingredients and continues through rigorous quality control standards to ensure consistency in every pack. From chilli powder and black pepper to a growing range of culinary essentials, every KHAS product is crafted to meet the highest standards of freshness and purity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="khas-about-text-block">
        <p class="khas-about-text">
          We take pride in combining traditional spice expertise with modern food safety practices, creating products trusted by households, retailers, and food professionals alike.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Values Section -->
      <div class="khas-about-values">
        <div class="khas-value-item">
          <div class="khas-value-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fabd2f" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="khas-value-title">Pure Ingredients</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="khas-value-divider"></div>

        <div class="khas-value-item">
          <div class="khas-value-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fabd2f" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"></path>
            </svg>
